  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Denial of service via unbounded consecutive reads on\n     a TCP/DoT connection\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-80225.patch: limit the number of pipelined\n       TCP/DoT queries drained per event loop turn and defer the rest with\n       a zero-delay timer\n     - CVE-2026-80225\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: Heap buffer overflow during DNSSEC RRset\n     canonicalisation\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-81634.patch: check the RRSIG rdata, the\n       first owner name and each RR's rdata against the remaining buffer\n       space in rrset_canonical()\n     - CVE-2026-81634",
